# Real-number work as modules do it: floor/ceiling/round(to), .abs,
# .sign, min/max as infixes and assignments, sqrt/log/exp, Inf and NaN,
# approximate equality.

=== num-floor-fraction
from: Astro::Utils 0.0.3 lib/Astro/Utils.rakumod:9
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method floor
--- code
sub frac(\x) { x - x.floor }
say frac(3.75);
say frac(-3.75);
say frac(2.5e0);
--- expect
0.75
0.25
0.5

=== num-floor-percentage
from: BDD::Behave 0.9.5 lib/BDD/Behave/Coverage.rakumod:443
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method floor
--- code
for 0.5, 2/3, 0.999, 1 -> $frac {
    my $pct  = ($frac * 100).floor;
    say "$pct% {$pct.^name}";
}
--- expect
50% Int
66% Int
99% Int
100% Int

=== num-floor-ceiling-hyper
