=== num-floor-offset-hours
from: DateTime::Format 0.1.5 lib/DateTime/Format.rakumod:103
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method floor
--- code
for 19800, -12600, 0 -> $o {
    say $o
        ?? sprintf('%s%02d%02d',
               $o < 0 ?? '-' !! '+',
               ($o.abs / 60 / 60).floor,
               ($o.abs / 60 % 60).floor)
        !! 'Z';
}
--- expect
+0530
-0330
Z

