=== num-floor-ceiling-nice-ticks
from: Selkie 0.16.0 lib/Selkie/Plot/Ticks.rakumod:159
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method ceiling
--- code
my ($min, $max, $step) = 3.7, 47.2, 10;
my $nice-min = ($min / $step).floor * $step;
my $nice-max = ($max / $step).ceiling * $step;
say "$nice-min .. $nice-max";
say ($nice-min, * + $step ... $nice-max).join(' ');
--- expect
0 .. 50
0 10 20 30 40 50

=== num-ceiling-floor-power-of-two
from: Crypt::LibScrypt 0.0.9 lib/Crypt/LibScrypt.rakumod:18
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: decl subset
--- code
my subset PowTwo of Int where { $_ > 1 && (ceiling(log2($_)) == floor(log2($_))) };
say 1024 ~~ PowTwo;
say 1000 ~~ PowTwo;
say 1 ~~ PowTwo;
say (1..20).grep(PowTwo);
--- expect
True
False
False
(2 4 8 16)

=== num-ceiling-log10-digits
from: Data::Generators 0.1.11 lib/Data/Generators/RandomTabularDataset.rakumod:184
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method ceiling
--- code
for 9, 10, 11, 250 -> $elems {
    my Str $nd = ceiling(log10($elems)).Str;
    say "$elems -> width $nd: {sprintf('%0' ~ $nd ~ 'd', 7)}";
}
--- expect
9 -> width 1: 7
10 -> width 1: 7
11 -> width 2: 07
250 -> width 3: 007

