=== num-log-ratio-exponent
from: Data::MessagePack 0.1.4 lib/Data/MessagePack/Packer.rakumod:107
license: Artistic-2.0
feature: method log
--- code
for 1.5, 10, 0.1 -> $f {
    my $abs = $f.abs;
    my $exp = ($abs.log / 2.log).Int;
    my $mantissa = $abs / 2**$exp;
    say "$exp {$mantissa.round(1e-9)}";
}
--- expect
0 1.5
3 1.25
-3 0.8

